  "purpose": "Homebrew tap (aien-dev/omega) whose Formula/omc.rb births omc from omega-mv's 408-byte seed at the pinned commit with seed/omega-from-seed.sh and refuses any omc whose sha256 differs from the pinned value; Linux arm64 only.",
